## 18. Future Work

- External validation on at least one independent pediatric ECG cohort.
- Fine-grained 19-class classification with hierarchical loss (structural → CHD subtype, etc.).
- Record-level aggregation strategies benchmarked against beat-level performance.
- Replacement of one CNN expert with a transformer-based or signal-processing-based pipeline, to test whether more genuinely heterogeneous inductive biases unlock larger fusion gains.
- A small reader study in which cardiologists rate the saliency maps produced by the four methods for clinical plausibility.
- Calibration of the model's predicted probabilities (we report AUROC but not Brier score or expected calibration error).

